# UI Navigation & Context Fixes Walkthrough

Here is a summary of the fixes applied to resolve the navigation errors and lingering SaaS text template issues you encountered.

## What Was Changed

### 1. Login Page Text Fixed
- **File modified:** `frontend/app/login/page.tsx`
- **What changed:** Replaced the confusing *"Sign in to manage your Webhooks & AI Agents"* subheader with *"Sign in to manage your alumni connections & referrals"*. 
- **Impact:** The login page now accurately reflects the PRO ALUMN platform. You will no longer feel like you're being thrown to a "demo" login page when accessing protected routes like `/jobs` or `/referrals`.

### 2. Landing Page Navigation Fixed
- **File modified:** `frontend/app/page.tsx`
- **What changed:** 
  - The "Network & AI Matching" feature card now points to `/directory` instead of `/network`.
  - The "Explore the Network" call-to-action button now properly links to `/directory`.
  - The hero search bar (`Search alumni by company...`) now routes queries to `/directory?q=...` instead of `/network?q=...`.
- **Impact:** Clicking these links will now take you to the correct directory page instead of throwing a `Route not found` or 404 error.

### 3. Help Center Content Updated
- **File modified:** `frontend/app/help/page.tsx`
- **What changed:** Replaced lingering "Webhook" and SaaS jargon.
  - "Setting up webhook notifications..." -> "Setting up email notifications..."
  - "Webhook Delivery" -> "Email Delivery"
  - Search placeholder updated from "webhook issues" to "platform issues, connections".
- **Impact:** The help center content is now fully aligned with an Alumni networking platform.

## Verification
- ✅ Landing page links have been verified to point to `/directory`.
- ✅ Protected routes like `/jobs` (Browse Opportunities) will now redirect you to an accurate, on-brand Login page if you are unauthenticated.
